From: "Codex handoff (Claude)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 00:39:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Webinars front door: list both brands' webinars and open them
 signed in via Relaunch72

Adds a Webinars section that lists Property Predator and Martin Howard Property
webinars from the Relaunch72 bridge (GET /api/group-hq/webinars, same bearer
token as the CRM read bridge) and opens any host, studio, people or edit page on
the brand host through a signed two-minute single-use handoff token, so the
founder signs in once here and never again on the brand hosts.

- app/services/relaunch72_sso.py: token signer (byte-identical to
  orchestrator/src/portal/group-hq-sso.ts, shared test vector)
- app/services/relaunch72_webinars.py: validated read of the webinar listing
- app/routers/webinars.py, app/templates/webinars.html, nav link
- config/.env.example/render.yaml: R72_SSO_SECRET, R72_PP_HOST, R72_MHP_HOST (names only)
- unit_checks: signer vector, listing parser, route smoke
- docs/relaunch72-webinars.md: how it works, settings, release sequence

